gives me anxiety. I overthink too much about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.540
everything that can go wrong from my backpack&nbsp;
being stolen to losing my passport somewhere&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:34.980
to even being pulled over at the airport&nbsp;
because they thought I was a Russian spy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:38.700
which did happen to me once in&nbsp;
a Florida airport, true story.&nbsp;

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:44.280
With that said, ironically, despite not liking&nbsp;
to travel, I have traveled a lot in my life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:50.640
