00:27:52.281 --> 00:27:53.215
@NotShady9
Other than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:53.215 --> 00:27:56.575
early medieval Eastern Europe what are&nbsp;
your favourite subjects in history?

00:27:56.575 --> 00:28:00.715
Ahhh, I see you know my favorite subject&nbsp;
is early medieval Eastern Europe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:00.715 --> 00:28:04.555
I would argue that it’s early medieval&nbsp;
Europe in general not just eastern Europe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:04.555 --> 00:28:08.935
but I do tend to focus on eastern Europe&nbsp;
a lot so fair enough. Other than that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:08.935 --> 00:28:15.475
honestly, depends. It fluctuates quite a bit. Of&nbsp;
course, strong candidates are Classical Greece&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:15.475 --> 00:28:20.635
and Austria-Hungary. Mexican or Latin American&nbsp;
history in general is a strong second. Recently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:20.635 --> 00:28:24.895
I also got really into Spanish history since&nbsp;
